			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. heading create sales order to only **Sales Order**\n2. remove above and below content of header\n3. Order source\n\t1. give few options first \n\t\t1. website\n\t\t2. direct sales\n\t\t3. customer po\n\t\t4. repeat/contract\n\t\t5. social media\n\t\t6. + add others\n\t2. must be in drop down format\n4. Customer name must not be shown directly\n\t1. instead use their ID\n\t2. when we try to search the name it \"ID\" must be only seen\n\t3. name must be not shown until user clicks for view button\n5. remove sales person field\n6. remove place of supply field\n7. add customer mobile number and email id\n8. remove currency field",
